# Cursor ACP provider. Authenticate the runtime user with cursor-agent login
# (ACP method cursor_login) or set CURSOR_API_KEY. A non-empty key is not proof:
# Agent Bridge verified keys with a bounded isolated ACP turn. Account auth is
# checked via cursor-agent status --format json. Qualification is optional
# diagnostic evidence; current hard failures suppress routing. Credentials stay
# workspace-local. Agent Bridge does not store Cursor credentials or API keys.
# CURSOR_ACP_COMMAND=
# CURSOR_ACP_ARGS=
# CURSOR_API_KEY=
# CURSOR_MODEL_PREFERENCE=composer-2.5,auto
# CURSOR_EXECUTION_MODE=safe
# TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN_CURSOR=
